@en "data"
@fa "داده"
@ar "بيانات"
package data

// Getting bytes into matrices and tensors, and iterating what arrives.
//
// This package is the loading half of the ML family: CSV text into a typed
// staging Table, IDX/MNIST files into matrices, seeded synthetic datasets
// for tests and examples, and batch iteration for training loops. The
// learning half - fitted transforms with train/test asymmetry, estimators,
// metrics - lives in std/ml, which deliberately does not depend on this
// package: any n x p matrix.Matrix works there, wherever it came from.
//
// Everything stochastic in here takes an explicit seed and builds its own
// matrix.Rng from it. Nothing touches std/rand's global state, so a fixed
// seed produces the same dataset on every machine, every run, at any
// parallelism - which is what lets a training demo assert its accuracy in
// a checked-in expected-output file.
//
// Ownership follows std/matrix: functions returning a Matrix transfer
// ownership, and out-parameters (`y &: matrix.Matrix`) overwrite a matrix
// the caller already owns, freeing nothing.

// Column kinds a CSV Table reports after dtype inference.
@en "COL_FLOAT"
@fa "ستون اعشاری"
@ar "عمود عشري"
pub const COL_FLOAT := 0

@en "COL_INT"
@fa "ستون صحیح"
@ar "عمود صحيح"
pub const COL_INT := 1

@en "COL_CAT"
@fa "ستون رده‌ای"
@ar "عمود فئوي"
pub const COL_CAT := 2

@en "COL_STR"
@fa "ستون رشته‌ای"
@ar "عمود نصي"
pub const COL_STR := 3
